OL,3,AGrooming gangs inquiry expanded to
OL,4,ABirmingham and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FA national inquiry into child sexual
OL,7,Fabuse by grooming gangs has announced
OL,8,Fthat targeted investigations will take
OL,9,Fplace in Birmingham and Wales.
OL,11,FThe inquiry said the probes would
OL,12,F"examine the sexual abuse and
OL,13,Fexploitation of children by grooming
OL,14,Fgangs and the response of organisations
OL,15,Fresponsible for protecting children" in
OL,16,Fboth areas.
OL,18,FOldham in Greater Manchester, Bradford
OL,19,Fand Keighley in West Yorkshire and
OL,20,FLondon were announced as the first
OL,21,Flocations for investigations earlier
OL,22,Fthis year.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
