OL,3,AGrooming gangs inquiry expanded to
OL,4,ABirmingham and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is unclear whether further areas
OL,7,Fwill be selected. Some survivors have
OL,8,Fexpressed frustration that their
OL,9,Flocation has not yet been included and
OL,10,Fsaid they were concerned about
OL,11,Fexpanding the inquiry's scope.
